# Frontend Rules

## Design System
- Use brand tokens only — never hardcoded hex values
- Color ratios: cream 65%, blush 20%, teal 10%, gold 5%
- Blush on feminine/soft sections, teal on strong/CTA sections
- Gold is accent only — never use as background
- Consistent max-w-5xl container width across all pages
- Section padding minimum py-32 — generous spacing always
- Cards: rounded-3xl minimum, never sharp corners

## Typography
- font-display for all headings and Arabic text
- font-body for all body copy
- Eyebrow labels: text-brand-gold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs font-light
- Display headings: font-display font-[200] for cinematic lightness
- Use clamp() for responsive display text sizing
- Use relative units (rem, em) for font sizes
- Adjust line-height and letter-spacing for Arabic readability

## Layout
- Mobile-first approach always
- Use CSS Grid and Flexbox — avoid fixed positioning for layout
- Use relative units (%, rem, em) not fixed pixels
- Establish clear visual hierarchy to guide user attention
- Maintain consistent positioning of recurring elements
- Use progressive disclosure to reveal content as needed
- Consider thumb zones for important mobile interactive elements

## Responsive
- Use Tailwind breakpoints: sm, md, lg, xl
- Test at mobile viewport before desktop
- Touch targets minimum 44x44px with adequate spacing between them
- Design for content needs not specific devices

## Interactions
- Hover states: color/opacity transitions only — never scale that shifts layout
- Transitions: 150-300ms for micro-interactions
- Use transform/opacity only — never animate width, height, or layout properties
- Add cursor-pointer to all clickable cards and interactive elements
- No layout shift on hover states
- Use loading indicators for async operations
- Provide clear error messages and recovery options

## Gradient Transitions
- Never use hard color edges between sections
- Always route through intermediate color: cream → blush → teal
- Never cream → teal directly
- Gradient bridge minimum h-32, preferred h-48 for large color shifts
- Add pointer-events-none to all gradient bridge divs

## Images
- Always use next/image with explicit width and height
- Use unoptimized prop for external URLs (Unsplash etc.)
- All images need descriptive alt text
- Modest imagery only — no revealing clothing, no mixed gender